{"title":"Linux-yum","slug":"Linux-yum","date":"2024-10-16T10:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-10-16T14:00:00.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Linux-yum.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h1><p><code>yum（Yellowdog Updater, Modified）</code>是一个用于管理 Linux 软件包的包管理工具，主要用于基于 RPM 的 Linux 分发版，如 <code>CentOS</code><br>和 <code>Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL)</code>。下面是关于 yum 的一些重要知识点和基本用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-基本概念\"><a href=\"#1-基本概念\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 基本概念\"></a>1. 基本概念</h2><p><strong>软件仓库（Repository）</strong>：yum 从配置好的软件仓库中获取软件包和更新。仓库可以是本地的或者远程的。</p>\n<p><strong>RPM 包</strong>：yum 依赖于 RPM （Red Hat Package Manager）格式的包。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-常用命令\"><a href=\"#2-常用命令\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 常用命令\"></a>2. 常用命令</h2><ul>\n<li><p><strong>安装软件包</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum install [package_name]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum install vim          <span class=\"comment\"># 安装vim</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>卸载软件包</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum remove [package_name]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum remove vim         <span class=\"comment\"># 卸载vim</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>更新软件包</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum update [package_name]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum update vim</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>要更新系统中所有可更新的软件包，可以使用:</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum update [package_name]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum update vim</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>查看已安装软件包</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum list installed</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>查看已安装软件包</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum search [keyword]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum search httpd           <span class=\"comment\"># 搜索httpd</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>显示软件包信息</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum info [package_name]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum info vim             <span class=\"comment\"># 显示vim的信息</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"3-配置-Yum-仓库-重要\"><a href=\"#3-配置-Yum-仓库-重要\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 配置 Yum 仓库 (重要)\"></a>3. 配置 Yum 仓库 (重要)</h2><p>Yum 的仓库配置文件通常位于 <code>/etc/yum.repos.d/</code> 目录下。每个 .repo 文件描述一个或多个仓库。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>仓库配置文件格式</strong><br>一个 .repo 文件的基本格式如下：</p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[repository_id]</span><br><span class=\"line\">name=Repository Name</span><br><span class=\"line\">baseurl=Repository URL</span><br><span class=\"line\">enabled=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgcheck=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgkey=URL to GPG key</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>下面是参数讲解：</p>\n<details class=\"folding-tag\" orange><summary> 下面是参数讲解： </summary>\n              <div class='content'>\n              <p><strong>[repository_id]</strong>：仓库的唯一标识符，用于引用该仓库。</p><p><strong>name</strong>：对仓库的描述，可以是任何文本，方便用户识别。</p><p><strong>baseurl</strong>：仓库的 URL 地址，支持 HTTP、HTTPS、FTP 和文件路径。</p><p><strong>enabled</strong>：(0或1) 指定是否启用此仓库，1表示启用，0表示禁用。</p><p><strong>gpgcheck</strong>：(0或1) 指定是否检查软件包的 GPG 签名，增加安全性。</p><p><strong>gpgkey</strong>：指定 GPG 密钥的 URL，用于对软件包进行签名验证。</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n<details class=\"folding-tag\" orange><summary> 以下是一个具体的 .repo 文件示例： </summary>\n              <div class='content'>\n              <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[base]</span><br><span class=\"line\">name=CentOS-7 - Base</span><br><span class=\"line\">baseurl=http://mirror.centos.org/centos/7/os/x86_64/</span><br><span class=\"line\">enabled=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgcheck=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgkey=https://www.centos.org/keys/RPM-GPG-KEY-CentOS7</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">[updates]</span><br><span class=\"line\">name=CentOS-7 - Updates</span><br><span class=\"line\">baseurl=http://mirror.centos.org/centos/7/updates/x86_64/</span><br><span class=\"line\">enabled=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgcheck=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgkey=https://www.centos.org/keys/RPM-GPG-KEY-CentOS7</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>管理 Yum 仓库</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>添加新仓库</strong><br>创建一个新的 .repo 文件：<br>比如创建 <code>/etc/yum.repos.d/myrepo.repo</code>，并按照上述格式添加相应的内容。<br>向文件中添加仓库的配置信息。<br>保存并退出编辑器。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n","more":"<h1 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h1><p><code>yum（Yellowdog Updater, Modified）</code>是一个用于管理 Linux 软件包的包管理工具，主要用于基于 RPM 的 Linux 分发版，如 <code>CentOS</code><br>和 <code>Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL)</code>。下面是关于 yum 的一些重要知识点和基本用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-基本概念\"><a href=\"#1-基本概念\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 基本概念\"></a>1. 基本概念</h2><p><strong>软件仓库（Repository）</strong>：yum 从配置好的软件仓库中获取软件包和更新。仓库可以是本地的或者远程的。</p>\n<p><strong>RPM 包</strong>：yum 依赖于 RPM （Red Hat Package Manager）格式的包。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-常用命令\"><a href=\"#2-常用命令\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 常用命令\"></a>2. 常用命令</h2><ul>\n<li><p><strong>安装软件包</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum install [package_name]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum install vim          <span class=\"comment\"># 安装vim</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>卸载软件包</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum remove [package_name]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum remove vim         <span class=\"comment\"># 卸载vim</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>更新软件包</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum update [package_name]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum update vim</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>要更新系统中所有可更新的软件包，可以使用:</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum update [package_name]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum update vim</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>查看已安装软件包</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum list installed</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>查看已安装软件包</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum search [keyword]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum search httpd           <span class=\"comment\"># 搜索httpd</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>显示软件包信息</strong></p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum info [package_name]</span><br><span class=\"line\">yum info vim             <span class=\"comment\"># 显示vim的信息</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"3-配置-Yum-仓库-重要\"><a href=\"#3-配置-Yum-仓库-重要\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 配置 Yum 仓库 (重要)\"></a>3. 配置 Yum 仓库 (重要)</h2><p>Yum 的仓库配置文件通常位于 <code>/etc/yum.repos.d/</code> 目录下。每个 .repo 文件描述一个或多个仓库。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>仓库配置文件格式</strong><br>一个 .repo 文件的基本格式如下：</p>\n <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[repository_id]</span><br><span class=\"line\">name=Repository Name</span><br><span class=\"line\">baseurl=Repository URL</span><br><span class=\"line\">enabled=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgcheck=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgkey=URL to GPG key</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>下面是参数讲解：</p>\n<details class=\"folding-tag\" orange><summary> 下面是参数讲解： </summary>\n              <div class='content'>\n              <p><strong>[repository_id]</strong>：仓库的唯一标识符，用于引用该仓库。</p><p><strong>name</strong>：对仓库的描述，可以是任何文本，方便用户识别。</p><p><strong>baseurl</strong>：仓库的 URL 地址，支持 HTTP、HTTPS、FTP 和文件路径。</p><p><strong>enabled</strong>：(0或1) 指定是否启用此仓库，1表示启用，0表示禁用。</p><p><strong>gpgcheck</strong>：(0或1) 指定是否检查软件包的 GPG 签名，增加安全性。</p><p><strong>gpgkey</strong>：指定 GPG 密钥的 URL，用于对软件包进行签名验证。</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n<details class=\"folding-tag\" orange><summary> 以下是一个具体的 .repo 文件示例： </summary>\n              <div class='content'>\n              <figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[base]</span><br><span class=\"line\">name=CentOS-7 - Base</span><br><span class=\"line\">baseurl=http://mirror.centos.org/centos/7/os/x86_64/</span><br><span class=\"line\">enabled=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgcheck=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgkey=https://www.centos.org/keys/RPM-GPG-KEY-CentOS7</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">[updates]</span><br><span class=\"line\">name=CentOS-7 - Updates</span><br><span class=\"line\">baseurl=http://mirror.centos.org/centos/7/updates/x86_64/</span><br><span class=\"line\">enabled=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgcheck=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">gpgkey=https://www.centos.org/keys/RPM-GPG-KEY-CentOS7</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>管理 Yum 仓库</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>添加新仓库</strong><br>创建一个新的 .repo 文件：<br>比如创建 <code>/etc/yum.repos.d/myrepo.repo</code>，并按照上述格式添加相应的内容。<br>向文件中添加仓库的配置信息。<br>保存并退出编辑器。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n","categories":[{"name":"Linux","path":"api/categories/Linux.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Linux","path":"api/tags/Linux.json"}]}